\subsection{The $\SHI$ Radial Profiles}
\label{sec:profile}
We show all the $\SHI$ radial profiles in Figure~\ref{fig:profile}, with radius normalized to different units. 

In unit of kpc (Figure~\ref{fig:profile}-a), most MW-like galaxies have profiles extending beyond 50 kpc down to the data depth of $\log\,(\SHI/\Msunpcsq)=-2.4$.

